,"_key":"z18j3d0sf","text":"Bidview builds dental marketing strategies that connect the dots from search, trust, to booking, so your targets aren’t just numbers in a report. They’re names on your calendar."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"9jk3k92jh","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"omkrw671t","text":"Why Dental Marketing Strategies Matter"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"8d8h7hgnj","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ye4oa8pkt","text":"Patients are doing homework before they ever call.They check Google. Reviews. Your website. Your socials. Your photos. Your vibe.Then they decide in seconds whether you’re “safe” or “sketchy.”"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ucw4qdkp2","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"1aneqbmec","text":"A real strategy helps you:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"tofeukqm0","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"7vg8g22g6","text":"Be visible (when it matters)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"syl5u26s2","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"wqtt9egrp","text":"So you show up for “dentist near me,” not just your clinic name."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"tgzsf45ft","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"yav9giegb","text":"Be believable (fast)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ng3oz9qed","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"mb6c683ah","text":"So anxious patients feel like they’re in good hands before they step inside."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"5gdzpcrcs","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"43mgdatxr","text":"Be booked (consistently)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"dyye2004j","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"6jr750kds","text":"So your marketing isn’t just “nice to have”. It’s going to be a reliable source of predictable growth."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"pdei4t24e","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"18tyf8c1b","text":"Whether you’re building a new practice or trying to stabilize an established one, the goal stays the same: more bookings, better patients, less guessing."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"wm31isf2h","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"rtc0ac78i","text":"Our Proven Dental Marketing Strategies | Built to hit targets. Designed to fill chairs"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"0mzwygqss","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"mn05eipjd","text":"1) Search Engine Optimization (SEO)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ir5wzdioo","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"lubxd0k9a","text":"SEO is how patients find you "},{"_type":"span","_key":"o5n8lo594","text":"without you paying for every click","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"iv7qjm2aq","text":"."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"smm2zk9by","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"vx2q98cvc","text":"We optimize your presence so you rank for high-intent searches like:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"pz50643ei","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"9fpax9jwd","text":"“teeth cleaning near me”"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"bpoegge1n","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"5ggntakby","text":"“emergency dentist”"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4g3q4hajs","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"yppyaqe16","text":"“Invisalign [in your city]”"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"wqp6hf97b","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"8h11pczhj","text":"“kids dentist”"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"lac301jmw","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"g53wr6mgs","text":"What Bidview Marketing does:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"v6z6tzvhe","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"qax8lannw","text":"Local SEO: Google Business Profile, citations, location signals, Maps visibility"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"qvomzp9ef","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"3z3pxmkpj"