","_key":"i1zghei9p","text":"What we produce:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"wepyd08rv","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"acnx4u0ht","text":"blogs and articles patients actually read"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"lzew01j3k","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"lysrxpvjw","text":"service explainers that convert"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"txp8t4l6q","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"xefje5p2i","text":"videos (FAQs, quick tips, testimonials, procedures explained simply)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4mflzekfp","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"et1b2khzw","text":"5) Email Marketing"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b9aev519o","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"89r7jc66g","text":"You already have a goldmine: past patients, inquiries, and “almost booked” leads."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4z9tfu36r","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"izya8l7ko","text":"Most clinics waste it by sending… nothing."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"0aczdv69x","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"g0bt216wz","text":"What Bidview does:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ggxoxyleb","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"4715105ue","text":"appointment reminders + recall systems"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"kutbx2byj","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"tg2x1xor9","text":"“we miss you” reactivation campaigns"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"8je1rijce","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"1htsu5m6o","text":"promos that don’t cheapen your brand"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"a4larlp66","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"fl3alzr49","text":"simple nurture sequences that turn hesitant leads into bookings"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"r613bgwjk","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"iv9vay7cx","text":"6) Reputation Management"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ivjjvo9xc","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"eznme68m5","text":"Let’s not pretend: reviews are the new referrals.And patients trust strangers online more than your best ad."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"vifoq02wo","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"oa8ozrho5","text":"What Bidview Marketing does:"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"vhnnz92bu","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"cnx7gdf0b","text":"review generation systems that feel natural (not awkward)"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"g561kmaa4","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"0i3qd4qp1","text":"response strategies that protect your brand"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ovv2hrs17","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"cr7rno3i1","text":"visibility boosts from consistent review activity"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b8ouwi97k","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a35a5t42o","text":"Benefits of Bidview’s Dental Marketing Strategy"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"enngubsiy","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"flkdrz3mk","text":"Get more of the "},{"_type":"span","_key":"d14ws29in","text":"right","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"xr43yyxx3","text":" patients"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"by4mcu1m2","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"mtodhxun5","text":"Not bargain hunters. Not time-wasters. People ready to commit."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"23h8xaxco","style":"h3","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"cnt4eczaw","text":"Make your marketing measurable"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"3o53fwqkm","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"nlpb0ryie","text":"You’ll know what’s working because we track what matters:calls, messages, form fills, bookings."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"pe1em6p